  /**
   * meeting-service-es
   */
  /**
   * During an Elasticsearch incident, the infra team created a new index to save new meetings during the incident. So, we created the LOAD_FROM_OTHER_INDEX_IN_ES (meeting-service-es.load-from-new-index) flag to load data from this new index until our main index was back online.
   *
   * For a definitive solution to ease the load on a single index, we decided to create new indexes to save meetings by time. Also, we split audioServiceMetadata in a different index (also per time). Due this new structure, we stopped using the old flag created during the incident and created a new one to cover the new use case and to easily allow to add new indexes that will be created in the future.
   *
   * [Incident backup index Slack thread](https://firefliesapp.slack.com/archives/C0891444V9V/p1737458920661589?thread_ts=1737425038.532339&cid=C0891444V9V)
   */
  FEATURE_FLAGS["SPLIT_INDEX_ES"] = "meeting-service-es.split-index";
  /**
   * During the same incident mentioned in the SPLIT_INDEX_ES flag, we created a logic to load data from Mongo to cover the elastic search outage. The flag related to this was LOAD_FROM_MONGO_IN_ES = "meeting-service-es.load-from-mongo"
   *
   * After allowing to load data from multiple data sources, it was created the LOAD_FROM_OTHER_INDEX_IN_ES (meeting-service-es.load-from-new-index) to replace the LOAD_FROM_MONGO_IN_ES one, but had a confusing name (as it was not only loading from the new index, but also from MongoDB).
   *
   * So, after the changes made in the definitive solution mentioned in the SPLIT_INDEX_ES flag (splitting audioServiceMetadata in a different index and per time), the structure of the flag LOAD_FROM_OTHER_INDEX_IN_ES was not enough to cover the new use case.
   *
   * Due the new structure and to have a more intuitive name (fetch from multiple data sources, not only MongoDB), we created this new flag.
   *
   * [Initial Mongo Slack thread](https://firefliesapp.slack.com/archives/C0891444V9V/p1737459816708709?thread_ts=1737425038.532339&cid=C0891444V9V)
   * */
  FEATURE_FLAGS["LOAD_FROM_MULTIPLE_DATA_SOURCES"] =
    "meeting-service-es.load-from-multiple-data-sources";
  FEATURE_FLAGS["USE_MONGO_FOR_LISTING"] = "meeting-service-es.use-mongo";
  FEATURE_FLAGS["ENABLE_TRACK_TOTAL_HITS"] =
    "meeting-service-es.enable-track-total-hits";
  FEATURE_FLAGS["ATLAS_SEARCH"] = "meeting-service-es.atlas-search";
  FEATURE_FLAGS["TEAM_ID_FOR_TEAMMATE_SEARCH"] =
    "meeting-service-es.team-id-for-teammate-search";
